/// [Holdings] A loan facility. Frontier Rhea has a floating-rate home loan (loan-home-001) and an education loan. Current principal is what is still owed; EMI is the monthly instalment. A disbursed loan is a liability, not income. Standards: BIAN 13.0.0 Consumer Loan (custom), Customer Product and Service Directory (custom); Microsoft CDM FHLoan (semantic reference only). Demo mapping, not certification. Star role: dimension; grain: one loan. Lakehouse: dim_loan <- silver_loan <- loans.json. Official CDM name aliases: FHLoan.integrationKey, FHLoan.principalAmount, FHLoan.balanceDisplayValue, FHLoan.installmentAmount, FHLoan.interestrate, FHLoan.maturitydate (semantic reference only).
entity Loan
	lineageTag: 6628aa6a-619c-5ca2-9798-a96143b08791
	backingTable: Loan
	keyProperty: LoanId

